speechtext:
For a return showing:-
1.	The names of all persons employed in the superintendent's office under the provisions of the Prairie Farm Assistance Act in the province of Saskatchewan at any time during the year 1940;
2.	The dates of employment of each individual, the position held by and the salary and expenses paid to each such individual;
3.	The premises leased under the provisions of the said act in the city of Regina, from whom leased, the area of floor space, the rentals paid and the sum expended on alterations, repairs, furniture and equipment;
4.	Whether the employees were employed through the civil service commission, or on whose recommendation.
